        <span data-key="Ubuntu supports many backup and snapshot technologies, but its reviewed default desktop scope identified no automatic recovery points around every APT transaction.">@Localizer["Ubuntu supports many backup and snapshot technologies, but its reviewed default desktop scope identified no automatic recovery points around every APT transaction."]</span>
